o series, Strange Dungeon series</strong> and <strong>Darkest Dungeon series</strong>, and Dark and Darker, Project FD will give you with  a unique and new fun experience in the dungeon crawler genre. </p>", "short_description": "Project FD combines dungeon extraction games and pixel art to create a new action experience. Explore dungeons discovered in ancient ruins , overcome monsters and traps, complete missions, and acquire loot. If you work together with friends, you can deal with many more threats.", "supported_languages": "English, Japanese, Korean, Simplified Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524280/header.jpg?t=1774579687", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524280/16ae4537c6553ad9b8db50fdf2163429971809e4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774579687", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3524280/16ae4537c6553ad9b8db50fdf2163429971809e4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774579687", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows® 10 / 11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen™ 3 1200 / Intel® Core™ i3-6100<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> AMD Radeon™ RX 460 / NVIDIA® GeForce® GTX 750<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen™ 3 1200 / Intel® Core™ i5-6400<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> AMD Radeon™ RX 470 / Intel® Arc™ A750 / NVIDIA® GeForce® GTX 1060 6GB VRAM<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet conne